// set_clean_up() deadline-sweep fixture.
//
// clean_up() destructs the object, so the backend sweep's invocation is
// observable from C++ (O_DESTRUCTED) without an LPC-side counter that a
// cross-thread sweep would have to expose. Driven by
// DriverTest.TestCleanUpDeadlineSweepAppliesAndRevertsToOneShot in
// src/tests/test_lpc.cc.
void create() {
}

void clean_up(int inherited) {
    destruct(this_object());
}
